

# 🧠 Sliding Window — The Core Idea

Sliding window is used when:

✔ You are working with **contiguous subarrays / substrings**
✔ You want to **optimize brute force O(n²)**
✔ You maintain a **dynamic window `[left, right]`**

Instead of recomputing everything, you **expand and shrink the window**.

```
[l ......... r]
```

