# 🧩 The Core Sliding Window Skeleton

This is the **master template**.

```python
left = 0

for right in range(len(nums)):

    # 1. expand window
    add(nums[right])

    # 2. shrink window if invalid
    while window_invalid():
        remove(nums[left])
        left += 1

    # 3. update answer
    update_result()
```

### Roles

| Pointer    | Role            |
| ---------- | --------------- |
| `right`    | expands window  |
| `left`     | shrinks window  |
| `add()`    | include element |
| `remove()` | exclude element |

This skeleton solves **80% of sliding window problems**.

