# 🧭 Sliding Window Summary Table

| Pattern          | When Used         | Window Rule            |
| ---------------- | ----------------- | ---------------------- |
| Fixed Window     | size = k          | `if size == k`         |
| Longest Window   | maximize length   | shrink when invalid    |
| Minimum Window   | minimize length   | shrink when valid      |
| Frequency Window | string problems   | use hashmap            |
| At Most K Trick  | counting problems | `count += window_size` |

